---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import { siteData } from "@/data/site";

const { social, referral, name } = siteData;
---

<PageLayout
	title="About Pinoy Techie"
	description="Pinoy Techie is a YouTube channel of Philippine facts and stories, plus plain-language MariBank, GCash and Maya guides. See what we make and how referral rewards work."
	lead="Philippine facts and stories in long videos and Shorts, plus honest guides to MariBank, GCash, Maya and everyday money apps."
	path="/about/"
	type="AboutPage">
	<h2>Who we are</h2>
	<p>
		{name} is a YouTube channel about the Philippines: facts worth knowing and stories worth sharing, in long videos and Shorts.
		We began with tech how-tos, and those videos are still here, but our focus now is Philippine facts and stories.
	</p>
	<p>
		This website brings it all together: the videos and Shorts, plus longer, searchable written guides on the money-app topics
		people keep asking about, starting with MariBank.
	</p>

	<h2>What you will find here</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Videos</strong>: Philippine facts and stories in long form, plus our earlier tech how-tos, on the <a href="/videos/">videos page</a>.</li>
		<li><strong>Shorts</strong>: quick facts, Filipino stories and viral moments in under a minute, on the <a href="/shorts/">Shorts page</a>.</li>
		<li><strong>Guides</strong>: step-by-step how-tos, such as <a href="/blog/how-to-open-maribank-account/">opening a MariBank account</a>.</li>
		<li><strong>Comparisons</strong>: side-by-side looks, such as <a href="/blog/maribank-vs-gcash/">MariBank vs GCash</a>.</li>
		<li><strong>Safety checks</strong>: what to verify before you deposit, such as <a href="/blog/is-maribank-legit/">is MariBank legit</a>.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>How we write and update guides</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Each guide separates what is verified from what changes often, such as savings rates and promo terms.</li>
		<li>Every article shows when it was published and, if it changed, when it was last updated.</li>
		<li>We point you to the official app or regulator for the latest numbers instead of guessing.</li>
		<li>Read the full process, including how we use AI, on <a href="/editorial-policy/">How we verify and update guides</a>.</li>
		<li>Found a mistake in a guide or a video? <a href="/contact/">Tell us</a> and we will correct it and note the update date.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2 id="disclosure">Referral disclosure</h2>
	<p>
		This site shares the MariBank referral code <strong>{referral.code}</strong>. New users who sign up with it can receive
		{referral.bonus} after meeting MariBank's deposit conditions. Referral programs usually reward the person who shared the code
		too, so we may earn a reward when you sign up with it.
	</p>
	<p>
		{name} is independent and is not affiliated with or endorsed by MariBank, Sea Group, GCash, Mynt, Globe, Maya or PLDT. MariBank and Maya set and can change
		their reward terms. Nothing on this site is financial advice. Read the full <a href="/disclosure/">referral disclosure</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>Contact</h2>
	<p>
		{
			social.email ? (
				<>Email <a href={`mailto:${social.email}`}>{social.email}</a>, or visit the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</>
			) : social.youtube ? (
				<>Message us on <a href={social.youtube} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">YouTube</a>, or visit the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</>
			) : (
				<>Visit the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</>
			)
		}
	</p>
</PageLayout>
